tle\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Muminoon 23:2 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"denjenigen, die in ihrem Gebet demütig sind,\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Muminoon\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/23.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 2\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/23-2.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/23.html\">Sura Al-Muminoon</a> › Vers 2</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Muminoon 23:2</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿الَّذِينَ هُمْ فِي صَلَاتِهِمْ خَاشِعُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">denjenigen, die in ihrem Gebet demütig sind,</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">فخشوع القلب يتضمن عبوديته لله وطمأنينته أيضا ولهذا كان الخشوع في الصلاة يتضمن هذا وهذا: التواضع والسكون.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/28</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن عباس والحسن وقتادة ومقاتل</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «قال: مخبتون أذلاء. وعن الحسن وقتادة: خائفون. وعن مقاتل: متواضعون.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/28</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مجاهد</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «غض البصر وخفض الجناح»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/28</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">عمرو بن دينار</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «ليس الخشوع الركوع والسجود؛ ولكنه السكون وحب حسن الهيئة في الصلاة.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 7/28</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s23a2\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><span></span><a href=\"/de/ayah/23-9.html\">Nächster Vers (23:9)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/23-9.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Muminoon 23:9 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"und denjenigen, die ihre Gebete einhalten.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"tr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/tr/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fr\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fr/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"bn\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/bn/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ms\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ms/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"fa\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/fa/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ru\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ru/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"sw\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/sw/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ha\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/es/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"de\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/zh/ayah/23-9.html\">\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsir von Al-Muminoon 23:9 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"und denjenigen, die ihre Gebete einhalten.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Startseite\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Al-Muminoon\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/surah/23.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Vers 9\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/23-9.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> › <a href=\"/de/surah/23.html\">Sura Al-Muminoon</a> › Vers 9</nav><h1>Tafsir von Sura Al-Muminoon 23:9</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿وَالَّذِينَ هُمْ عَلَىٰ صَلَوَاتِهِمْ يُحَافِظُونَ﴾</p><section><h3>Übersetzung der Bedeutung</h3><p class=\"tr\">und denjenigen, die ihre Gebete einhalten.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">German Translation - Frank Bubenheim — v1.1.4 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">Die Worte der beiden Imame werden im arabischen Original wortgetreu und mit Quellenangaben wiedergegeben.</p><section><h2>Schaich al-Islam Ibn Taimiyya</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وهذه الآيات تقتضي ذم من ترك شيئا من واجبات الصلاة وإن كان في الظاهر مصليا مثل أن يترك الوقت الواجب أو يترك تكميل الشرائط والأركان من الأعمال الظاهرة والباطنة وبذلك فسرها السلف.<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/572</cite></blockquote><h3>Was er von anderen überliefert hat</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">قتادة</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «على وضوئها ومواقيتها وركوعها»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/572</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">مسروق</span> <span class=\"st\">أقرّه</span> «على مواقيتها»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/572</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">ابن جريج</span> <span class=\"st\">ردّه</span> «المكتوبة والتي في سأل سائل: التطوع.»<cite>«مجموع الفتاوى» 22/572</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=de#s23a9\">Im interaktiven Tafsir öffnen (vollständige Texte)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/de/ayah/23-2.html\">Vorheriger Vers (23:2)</a><a href=\"/de/ayah/23-13.html\">Nächster Vers (23:13)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir der beiden Schaichs · <a href=\"/de/\">Startseite</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Über das Projekt</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Datenschutz &amp; Bedingungen</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/23-13.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir von Al-Muminoon 23:13 — nach Ibn Taimiyya und Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hierauf machten Wir ihn zu einem Samentropfen in einem festen Aufenthaltsort.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/de/ayah/23-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/23-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/23-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/23-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/23-13.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"i